OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOutbreaks of
OL,6,Frain in the west dying out this
OL,7,Fevening, elsewhere having a dry end to
OL,8,Fthe day. Then the rest of the night
OL,9,Fwill be dry.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSaturday:FThe east mainly dry and
OL,12,Fbright, some patchy rain later. The
OL,13,Fwest cloudier with occasional rain
OL,14,Fturning more persistent later.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FPatchy
OL,17,Frain on Sunday morning clearing south
OL,18,Fto leave a dry and brighter afternoon.
OL,19,FDry with sunny spells on Monday and
OL,20,FTuesday, turning warmer
